// Icon resource for heinrich-settings.exe.
//
// Kept ASCII-only on purpose: rc.exe reads .rc files with the ANSI code page
// unless a BOM is present, so CJK comments here would be decoded as garbage.
// The Chinese rationale lives in build.rs (fn embed_icon).
//
// The source .ico is the same file the IME list uses for its IconFile entry
// (data\icon\heinrich.ico, generated by tools\make-icon.ps1, 5 sizes:
// 16/20/24/32/48 @32bpp). Path is relative to the crate root, which is the
// working directory build.rs runs rc.exe in.
1 ICON "../../../data/icon/heinrich.ico"
